      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEADING SOUTH (3) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at Taree Super Track in a handy 17.53 beating Angelic Baroque. Has never missed the frame from three starts from this draw, including a win. Can continue the winning form. JACOBITE BATTLE (2) has a strong record here with two wins and three placings from six starts. In the money last time at this track (23.31) in a NG, finishing a 2.5 lengths third. Looks a key chance on best figures. ARMATREE STRIPE (7) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Total Treasure (22.98) in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expecting another good run. LITTLE KING (8) can sneak into the finish.",
